---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<Base title="Apply" description="Request a Kingdom Factor fit conversation and clarify the right next step for your leadership season." canonical="/apply/">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Fit conversation"
    title="Ensure you're in the room where wisdom surrounds you."
    text="A fit conversation helps you clarify your next step, whether that's peer advisory, the Kingdom Culture Intensive, executive coaching, or marketplace ministry consulting that best supports the decisions you are carrying."
    primary={{ label: "See conversation path", href: "#conversation-path" }}
    secondary={{ label: "Compare the two lanes", href: "/" }}
  />
  <section id="book" class="content-section offer-detail-section apply-book-section">
    <div class="section-header compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">Request a fit conversation</p>
      <h2>Book directly with John or Jim.</h2>
      <p>Choose the leader you'd like to talk with and schedule a confidential fit conversation. Both lead Kingdom Factor Peer Advisory Groups and walk alongside Christian owners and leaders carrying real decisions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-grid apply-book-grid">
      <article class="content-card premium-card offer-detail-card">
        <span class="card-number">01</span>
        <h3>Dr. John Lybarger</h3>
        <p>Schedule a fit conversation with Dr. John Lybarger to discern the right room for your leadership season.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://jlybarger.kingdomfactor.us/meeting-length" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule with Dr. John Lybarger</a>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card premium-card offer-detail-card">
        <span class="card-number">02</span>
        <h3>Jim Lybarger</h3>
        <p>Schedule a fit conversation with Jim Lybarger to explore the path that best supports you and your business.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://api.gohighroad.com/widget/bookings/jclybarger-60" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule with Jim Lybarger</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="conversation-path" class="content-section offer-detail-section apply-path-section">
    <div class="section-header compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
      <h2>A simple path to discern the right room.</h2>
      <p>No pressure, no generic pitch. The first step is clarity about your leadership season, the weight of your decisions, and the kind of counsel that would actually help.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-grid apply-path-grid">
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">01</span>
        <h3>Share the season</h3>
        <p>Identify the decisions, pressures, people questions, growth constraints, or faith-and-work tensions that are currently on the table.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">02</span>
        <h3>Clarify the room</h3>
        <p>Compare peer advisory, the Kingdom Culture Intensive, executive coaching, or marketplace ministry consulting.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="content-card premium-card">
        <span class="card-number">03</span>
        <h3>Choose the next step</h3>
        <p>If there is a fit, Kingdom Factor can recommend the right conversation, room, or resource path for the season you are leading through.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
